        "v": "A production order can be created and released with no stock, but it cannot be finished, because the material issue has nothing to issue. Buying the components in exercises the Purchase defaults and creates the purchase price history their standard cost is calculated from; the inventory figure at the raw-material warehouse, not the receipt status, is the proof."
